# Repository Context

## Repository Type
monorepo

<!-- Options: monorepo, polyrepo, library -->

## Project Structure

- `src/api` - Backend API service
- `src/ui` - Frontend application
- `src/shared` - Shared utilities

## Code Style Guidelines

- Use ESLint + Prettier
- TypeScript strict mode
- Prefer functional patterns

## Review Focus Areas

- Security for API endpoints
- Performance for UI components
- Type safety across the codebase

## Skip Patterns

- **/*.test.js - Test files
- **/dist/** - Build artifacts
- **/*.generated.* - Auto-generated files

## Custom Instructions

Review with production-readiness in mind. Flag security issues and performance bottlenecks.
